File: docs/redoc/v1.18.x/openapi.json, Lines 15823-15832
"query": {
  "description": "Query to perform. If missing without prefetches, returns points ordered by their IDs.",
  "anyOf": [
    {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/QueryInterface"},
    {"nullable": true}  // Explicitly allows null
  ]
}

Schema documentation says 'If missing... returns points ordered by IDs'. But nullable: true permits null (different from missing).

API accepts null query, returning all points ordered by ID per fallback behavior.
